ma gondii </italic>hsp70 genomic locus.</article-title><source>Int J Parasitol</source><year>2004</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>333</fpage><lpage>346</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15003494</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Behnke</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Radke</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>AT</given-names></name><name><surname>Sullivan</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The transcription of bradyzoite genes in <italic>Toxoplasma gondii </italic>is controlled by autonomous promoter elements.</article-title><source>Mol Microbiol</source><year>2008</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>1502</fpage><lpage>1518</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18433450</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Radke</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Behnke</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mackey</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Radke</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Roos</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The transcriptome of <italic>Toxoplasma gondii</italic>.</article-title><source>BMC Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>26</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16324218</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>JD</given-names></name><name><surname>Estep</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Tavazoie</surname><given-names>S</given-na